## Removed from the fork

The following upstream subsystems were dropped because this station does not
use them; consult upstream if you need them:

  * the ROS 2 packages (`ros2/`)
  * the FACTR gravity-compensation leader (`gello/factr/`)
  * the dm_control / MuJoCo simulation servers
  * the xArm / UR / Panda / YAM robot backends, and the Quest and SpaceMouse agents
  * the `run_env.py` / `launch_yaml.py` command-line teleop path and the
    `data_utils` / `utils` modules it drove — that branch depended on packages
    (`gdict`, `simple_bc`, `mediapy`, `natsort`, `transforms3d`, `pygame`) that
    were never installed here, so it could not run; the GUI never called it.

